<section image-layout="blank" id="ANgowHxrXr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="pDBvjEM_n1" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">Nguyễn Du · The Tale of Kiều</p><h1 font-size="44pt">A poem carried by its rhythm</h1><p font-size="lg"><b>Truyện Kiều turns a life under pressure into a test of how we judge choice.</b></p><p>Alternating six- and eight-syllable lines carry Thúy Kiều from vow to sacrifice, exploitation, resistance, and return. Narrative, ethics, and poetic form operate as one achievement.</p><spacer size="18pt"></spacer><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><p font-size="sm">Character · social realism · humanitarian value · lục bát</p></grid-item><grid-item id="6Go0Byn5TO" padding="0" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/QtwXbwgOWg-DMCIf.png" saved-media-id="dnednlm4384rxpz" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, an open manuscript folio without legible writing beside a river threshold and a narrow vermilion cord passing forward through the composition, Vietnamese chữ Nôm woodblock sensibility, lampblack, old gold and indigo under soft window light, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:864,&quot;height&quot;:1152}"></grid-item></grid><shape preset="line" x="56" y="454" w="848" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="krb3Ri3Dmw"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="hVLhsO1uHX" padding="0" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/ZQkGuWYHm8sK9YeTw_iyp.png" saved-media-id="z2jecmo6ylvf0tx" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, an imagined non-documentary literary portrait of Nguyễn Du seated near an unlettered manuscript folio, reserved expression, Vietnamese woodblock-inspired contours, lampblack robes with muted old gold and indigo details, soft window light, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item><grid-item id="sFwcG1CEzO" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><h2>Nguyễn Du and the work</h2><p><b>Nguyễn Du (1765–1820)</b> created a defining work of Vietnamese literature. <i>Truyện Kiều</i>, or <i>The Tale of Kiều</i>, comprises 3,254 lines written in chữ Nôm and composed in lục bát verse.</p><p>Its achievement is both narrative and formal: a long story sustained through voice, rhyme, cadence, and ethical tension.</p><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="wXp0AzLctl" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><display size="md" font-size="30pt">1765–1820</display><h4>Nguyễn Du</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="6i0inIUrMS" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><display size="md" font-size="40pt">3,254</display><h4>Lines</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="Y28tQENZtC" vertical-align="center" colspan="20"><display size="md" font-size="32pt">lục bát</display><h4>Form</h4><p font-size="sm">Composed in chữ Nôm.</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="sm">Interpretive illustration. Sources: <a href="https://baotangvanhoc.vn/hien-vat-hinh-anh/hien-vat-len-tieng/truyen-kieu-mot-kiet-tac-van-hoc/">Vietnamese Literature Museum</a>; <a href="https://www.nomfoundation.org/nom-project/Tale-of-Kieu?uiLang=vn">Vietnamese Nôm Preservation Foundation</a>.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="sK9WZy6RzN"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="JI3xSAeLQU" vertical-align="center" colspan="43"><h2>A life redirected by obligation</h2><p>Kiều’s story advances through choices made under increasing pressure.</p><smart-layout variant="minimalTimelineWithBoxes" orientation="vertical" cell-size="15"><smart-layout-item><h4>Love · Kim Trọng</h4><p>They exchange vows and imagine a shared future.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>Sacrifice · family crisis</h4><p>Kiều sells herself to rescue her family.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>Exploitation · Mã Giám Sinh and Tú Bà</h4><p>Trafficking is followed by unstable refuge and persecution.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>Reversal · Từ Hải</h4><p>Power briefly opens before Hồ Tôn Hiến’s deception.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>Return · Giác Duyên</h4><p>Rescue leads to a transformed reunion, not a reset.</p></smart-layout-item></smart-layout></grid-item><grid-item id="CtAdrnITem" padding="0" colspan="17"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/kMCAEh8py1gTY-civJCL-.png" saved-media-id="17vwjme5si9118s" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a non-documentary literary figure crossing successive Vietnamese gates toward a distant river, the path narrowing through shadow and opening again at dawn, lampblack, vermilion, old gold and indigo, manuscript and woodblock conventions, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="ILAB69lNX1"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/sMcA5Bjv27wPqxxdMMRLv.png" saved-media-id="dr3hk9auh08yv0i" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a non-documentary literary figure representing Thúy Kiều seated beside a stringed instrument at the left of the frame, alert and self-possessed while architectural screens narrow behind her, quiet open field on the right, Vietnamese manuscript and woodblock sensibility, lampblack, vermilion, old gold and indigo, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><freeform><box type="content" x="365" y="34" w="555" h="472" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="border: 1pt solid var(--neutral-border-color); border-radius: 4pt;"><p></p></box><shape preset="line" x="397" y="252" w="42" h="92" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><shape preset="line" x="430" y="342" w="42" h="92" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="405" y="60" w="470"><p role="eyebrow">Character study</p><h2>Thúy Kiều: gifted, ethical, constrained</h2><p>Artistically gifted and emotionally perceptive, Kiều acts decisively—inside social and material limits that keep narrowing.</p><p><b>Her agency is real—but never exercised on equal terms.</b></p></box><box type="content" x="405" y="216" w="450" h="72" vertical-align="center" sizing="fixed" style="padding: 9pt 16pt; border: 1pt solid var(--accent-color); border-radius: 3pt;"><h4>Love</h4><p>A future she actively values.</p></box><box type="content" x="438" y="306" w="417" h="72" vertical-align="center" sizing="fixed" style="padding: 9pt 16pt; border: 1pt solid var(--accent-color); border-radius: 3pt;"><h4>Filial duty</h4><p>She exchanges that future for family safety.</p></box><box type="content" x="471" y="396" w="384" h="72" vertical-align="center" sizing="fixed" style="padding: 9pt 16pt; border: 1pt solid var(--accent-color); border-radius: 3pt;"><h4>Survival</h4><p>Compromise, trust, resistance, or flight.</p></box><box type="content" x="46" y="478" w="210" h="30" vertical-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 4pt 10pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">Interpretive illustration.</p></box></freeform></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="PcsKKeIAM7" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="VMGbYYLq_P" vertical-align="center" colspan="21"><labels><label variant="solid">Interpretive claim</label></labels><h2>Realism: a social world closes in</h2><p>The poem’s realistic value lies in exposing a system, not merely describing individual misfortune.</p><p>Actors change across Kiều’s reversals; unequal rules and recurring forms of coercion remain.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="YZplXHOGkA" align="center" vertical-align="center" colspan="39"><diagram template-key="inputs" align="center" width="560pt" height="350pt" data-meta="{&quot;general&quot;:[{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Structural injustice</h4>&quot;}],&quot;step&quot;:[{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Money</h4><p>Family crisis becomes a market for Kiều’s body.</p>&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Official language</h4><p>Coercion and betrayal appear as procedure.</p>&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Gendered judgment</h4><p>Female reputation is policed more harshly than male power.</p>&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;<h4>Repeated reversals</h4><p>Injustice recurs across changing actors.</p>&quot;}]}"></diagram></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="aRGt5c88w5"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="ZhJiyO8TJT"><h2>Humanitarian value: dignity under pressure</h2><p><b>A humanitarian reading</b> begins by refusing to confuse constrained choice with moral failure.</p><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="uT9I6zlZhS" cell-style="subtle" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Attention</p><h3>Intelligence and feeling</h3><p>The poem sustains attention to Kiều’s perception, talent, emotion, and pain.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="NiG-ijWxqg" cell-style="subtle" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Exposure</p><h3>Sacrifice under demand</h3><p>Her sacrifice invites compassion while exposing the conditions that require it.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="VqUvJUQ54_" cell-style="subtle" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Limit</p><h3>Talent without shelter</h3><p>Artistic gift and moral intelligence offer no protection from exploitation.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="nwIKehPnBZ" cell-style="subtle" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Aftermath</p><h3>Survival without erasure</h3><p>Rescue and reunion matter, but they do not cancel accumulated harm.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="qNxHLiQlEL"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="nbktSbpC8C"><h2>How lục bát moves</h2><freeform-block w="840" h="210"><box type="content" y="20" w="125"><p role="eyebrow">Six syllables</p></box><box type="content" y="128" w="125"><p role="eyebrow">Eight syllables</p></box><box type="content" x="145" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">1</p><h4>Trăm</h4></box><box type="content" x="245" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">2</p><h4>năm</h4></box><box type="content" x="345" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">3</p><h4>trong</h4></box><box type="content" x="445" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">4</p><h4>cõi</h4></box><box type="content" x="545" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">5</p><h4>người</h4></box><box type="content" x="645" y="8" w="82" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">6</p><h4>ta</h4></box><box type="content" x="145" y="116" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">1</p><h4>Chữ</h4></box><box type="content" x="230" y="116" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">2</p><h4>tài</h4></box><box type="content" x="315" y="116" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">3</p><h4>chữ</h4></box><box type="content" x="400" y="116" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">4</p><h4>mệnh</h4></box><box type="content" x="485" y="116" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">5</p><h4>khéo</h4></box><box type="content" x="570" y="116" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">6</p><h4>là</h4></box><box type="content" x="655" y="116" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">7</p><h4>ghét</h4></box><box type="content" x="740" y="116" w="78" h="62" vertical-align="center" horizontal-align="center" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="padding: 5pt; border-radius: 3pt;"><p role="caption">8</p><h4>nhau</h4></box><shape preset="line" x="607" y="92" w="87" h="2" rotation="-28" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape><box type="content" x="695" y="82" w="130"><p role="caption"><b>ta–là rhyme bridge</b></p></box></freeform-block><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="6X6snwE59F" colspan="20"><h4>Bridge</h4><p font-size="sm"><b>ta</b> and <b>là</b> rhyme at position six.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="aFT74gqgxP" colspan="20"><h4>Continuation</h4><p font-size="sm">The eight-syllable line’s final rhyme can connect to position six of the next six-syllable line.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="AaRIvyQBK1" colspan="20"><h4>Method</h4><p font-size="sm">Vietnamese tone and recurring rhyme shape cadence; English paraphrase cannot prove the original meter.</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="sm">Text source: <a href="https://www.nomfoundation.org/nom-project/Tale-of-Kieu?uiLang=vn">Vietnamese Nôm Preservation Foundation</a>.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="DRRlAou9Jr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="YhA-KQEVze" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">Conclusion</p><h1 font-size="36pt">Rhythm becomes an ethical argument</h1><p font-size="lg">Form and meaning cannot be separated. Six/eight alternation repeatedly opens and closes space; rhyme carries one line into the next, as Kiều’s choices carry consequences forward.</p><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><h3 role="subheading">Dignity survives what justice does not repair.</h3><p font-size="sm">The ending offers survival and reunion—not a simple reset.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="ozaN15RCxl" padding="0" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/Xw3OzZq3eNb1c4oO4GJcZ.png" saved-media-id="zqbqzwskt4eoc45" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a small boat at dawn crossing from a shadowed river gate into open water, its wake continuing beyond the right edge of the frame, Vietnamese manuscript and woodblock sensibility, lampblack, muted old gold and indigo with restrained vermilion accents, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item></grid><shape preset="line" x="56" y="468" w="904" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape></section>